=product @PRODUCER@ @BASE@ GAWK @PCSIVERSION@ full
1 'PRODUCER
=prompt @PRODUCER@
1 'PRODUCT
=prompt GNU awk @VERSION@ for OpenVMS
1 'NOTICE
=prompt GNU awk is free software under the GNU GPL, version 3 or later.
1 RELEASE_NOTES
=prompt Documentation is in [GAWK.DOC]README.VMS under the installation directory.
1 POST_INSTALL
=prompt Post-installation tasks for GNU awk
    At system startup: to define GAWK$ROOT at every boot, add this line to
    SYS$MANAGER:SYSTARTUP_VMS.COM:
    $ @SYS$STARTUP:GAWK$STARTUP.COM
    For each user: to define the gawk and awk commands, add this line to LOGIN.COM:
    $ @GAWK$ROOT:[000000]GAWK$SETUP.COM

PRODUCT REMOVE GAWK removes the product and deassigns GAWK$ROOT.
